# Scenario 'noadapter': the cartridge on a Game Boy with NO Mobile Adapter attached to the link port.
# Expected: "モバイルアダプタGBがささっていません" (Mobile Adapter GB is not plugged in) screen; the ROM re-tries the adapter
# check whenever a button is pressed. Buttons are pressed here to exercise that path.
wait 300                     # boot, adapter check fails
waitstable 60 max 400
shot no_adapter_screen
gap 40
tap A
wait 60
shot after_a
tap B
wait 60
shot after_b
tap START
wait 60
shot after_start
tap SELECT
wait 60
shot after_select
hold A 300
wait 60
shot after_hold_a
tap UP
tap DOWN
tap LEFT
tap RIGHT
wait 200
shot end
